cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MMDBBench: an open benchmark of multi-model databases"
message: If you use MMDBBench or its results, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Taewoon
    family-names: Kim
    email: taewoon@humem.ai
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2892-0194"
    affiliation: HumemAI
repository-code: "https://github.com/humemai/mmdbbench"
url: "https://humem.ai/research/mmdbbench"
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark of multi-model databases: one storage engine serving tables, time series, documents, graphs, key-values and vectors,
  measured against specialist databases as per-model baselines. The same tasks run on the same machine with published settings, and every
  result is tied to the exact engine version. Tasks are written in SQL, Cypher and native query languages, on x86 Linux, and the raw result rows are open.
license: MIT
